          "message": {
            "text": "Unauthenticated webhook trigger endpoint allows arbitrary tenant workflow execution (no auth, no HMAC, no replay/rate limit)\n\nThe webhook trigger endpoint POST /v1/webhook/:webhookId/trigger requires no authentication, no signature, and has no replay or rate protection. Anyone who obtains a webhook_id can invoke the victim organization's workflow arbitrarily many times, consuming LLM/agent execution resources and driving unauthorized state changes."
