            "text": "PoC app-hosting stack: docker.sock mounts, insecure Traefik dashboard, and hardcoded tenant JWT secrets\n\nThe app-hosting PoC stack ships with the Docker socket mounted into two containers, the Traefik dashboard exposed insecurely on all interfaces, and per-tenant JWT signing secrets hardcoded as predictable strings in source and Kubernetes manifests. While the directory is labelled a proof-of-concept, these patterns grant host-level code execution and cross-tenant token forgery on any host where the stack is run."
          },
