            "text": "Unauthenticated generic IM webhook processes attacker messages through the victim organization's agent\n\nThe generic IM webhook endpoint POST /api/im/webhook/:bindingId requires no authentication or signature. Anyone who knows (or brute-forces) a binding ID can submit arbitrary text that is processed by the victim organization's IM-bound agent, triggering agent execution and consuming the target tenant's resources."
