          "message": {
            "text": "agentAccess explicit-permission lookup ignores organization scoping (cross-org permission confusion)\n\nAgentAccessService.checkAccess() resolves explicit agent permissions by the (agent_id, user_id) pair without verifying that the agent belongs to the caller's organization. A user who holds (or obtains) a permission row for another organization's agent is granted that access level there, bypassing the org-scoped checks that guard the rest of the function."
