            "text": "CVE-2026-48779 in ws 8.19.0 (WebSocket small-fragment memory exhaustion DoS of the chat gateway)\n\nThe backend pins `ws` 8.19.0 (pulled by `@fastify/websocket` ^11.2.0) in `backend/package-lock.json`. All `ws` versions from 8.0.0 up to (not including) 8.21.0 are affected by a memory-exhaustion DoS (CVE-2026-48779): a peer can send a high volume of exceptionally small fragments whose structural wrappers consume far more memory than the documented message-size limit, OOM-killing the process. The backend's chat execution WebSocket gateway runs on this version."
          },
