          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-25223 in fastify 5.6.2 / 4.29.1 (Content-Type tab validation bypass)\n\nThe backend pins `fastify` 5.6.2 (direct dependency ^5.6.2) in `backend/package-lock.json`. fastify before 5.7.2 is affected by CVE-2026-25223 (advisory CVSS 7.5): request body validation schemas specified by Content-Type can be completely circumvented by appending a tab character followed by arbitrary content to the Content-Type header, while the server still processes the body as the original content type. The same CVE applies to the `app-hosting/poc` services, which pin fastify 4.29.1 (below the 4.x fix in the advisory's range)."
          },
