              "impact": "No application code in this repository uses the `ip-address` library, so the octal/decimal confusion has no reachable trust-boundary decision to subvert here. The finding documents the vulnerable pinned version in the agent runtime's dependency tree; it matters only if the SDK (or future code) performs IP-based filtering on attacker-controlled URLs using this library.",
              "remediation_steps": "Add an override in agentcore/package.json (\"overrides\": { \"ip-address\": \"^10.3.1\" }) to resolve a patched version in the SDK chain, or track the upstream @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk release that bumps the MCP SDK. No application change is required.",
              "dependency_metadata": {
                "package_name": "ip-address",
