                "contextual_cvss_reasoning": "ip-address 10.2.0 is installed in the agentcore runtime's dependency tree (via @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk -> @modelcontextprotocol/sdk per agentcore/package-lock.json), but application code never imports it (rg over agentcore/src, backend/src, frontend/src finds no Address4/Address6/ip-address usage). The advisory's vulnerable symbol is Address4.isPrivate()/correctForm() called with attacker-controlled host strings in a trust-boundary decision; with no caller of the library in any inspected source, the octal/decimal confusion path cannot execute under attacker input in this codebase, and any private-IP filtering that may exist inside the SDK is internal behavior not exercised by application-controlled data here. All impact metrics N as used."
