                "contextual_cvss_reasoning": "undici 6.24.1 is pinned in the backend tree but no application code imports it (rg over backend/src finds no undici import or ProxyAgent/checkServerIdentity usage). The advisory's vulnerable symbol is a caller-supplied tls.checkServerIdentity callback passed through an Agent dispatcher — with zero application callers constructing undici Agents, the dropped-callback path has no application-controlled input to act on; it can only execute inside the private internals of the packages that pull undici (claude-agent-sdk, discord.js), which do not receive application-provided TLS options here. All impact metrics N as used; the report documents the pinned vulnerable version."
